Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,ПРЕДСТ,,0,0,0,,ФАНСАБ-ГРУППА АЗАЛИИ ПРЕДСТАВЛЯЕТ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fade(00,0)\p1\a5\bord0\1a&H00&\pos(430,206)\fscx807\fscy277}m 0 0 l 0 0 l 92 0 l 92 38 l 0 38
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,работали,,0,0,0,,{\pos(801,256)}Над серией работали:\N Лилия, Тирамису, Бирюлька, Хозяин, Зингер
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,title,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(846,392)}How I became
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,name,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(848,456)}queen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,2:01:37.06,PRESENT,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1181,4)}AZALEA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.85,0:01:25.88,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Hwajin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.78,0:01:27.78,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Hwajin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.66,0:01:40.03,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,What’s lying there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.40,0:01:45.70,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,-Got it, I’m running for help.\N-No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.90,0:01:49.44,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,No one should know that I...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.67,0:01:52.77,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,What am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.17,0:01:55.18,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.38,0:02:02.28,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,10 episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:06.49,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,Why did you go there, where there are such terrible memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.29,0:02:08.86,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,Are you sure you can’t call anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.72,0:02:11.29,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,What if he dies in the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.06,0:02:16.46,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Are you having nightmares again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.66,0:02:19.03,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Hey, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.34,0:02:26.34,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Hwajin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.14,0:02:30.91,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Excellent. Think what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.29,0:02:40.39,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,That’s not good. I'll go find someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.96,0:02:45.03,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Well, here you are again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.23,0:02:46.83,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,I had a nightmare,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.10,0:02:52.23,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,that I died a worthless king.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.37,0:02:55.07,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Frightening nightmare, where am I
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.64,0:02:59.87,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,watched the world collapse
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.67,0:03:03.91,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,and couldn’t do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.45,0:03:08.82,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,Nobody asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.15,0:03:13.65,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Let's lie there for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.79,0:03:17.02,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.76,0:03:28.27,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,I’ll pretend to be Hwajin for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.15,0:03:42.95,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,10 episode: Life in a Nightmare
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.78,0:03:46.52,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Finally, you have become a queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.12,0:03:49.12,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Knew it would be like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.84,0:04:46.55,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,Secret
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.89,0:04:55.66,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,I’ll tell His Majesty everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.42,0:04:58.26,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,So that the past no longer influences us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.80,0:05:07.83,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.60,0:05:11.24,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,I need to talk to His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.67,0:05:14.71,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,The king and queen came out,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.04,0:05:17.01,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,and even Mr. Kim is not at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.96,0:06:09.00,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,Ovol.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.46,0:06:13.30,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,I can help the king and destroy the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.50,0:06:15.80,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.91,0:07:02.02,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.65,0:07:09.59,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,Time to wash.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.57,0:07:59.71,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.98,0:08:05.31,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,-What happened?\N-Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.31,0:08:08.28,Default,Silk1,0,0,0,,I almost touched you... That is, I almost died.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.78,0:08:10.45,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,You are so heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.42,0:08:14.62,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,It was dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.16,0:08:19.03,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,The accounting book was not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.43,0:08:22.13,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,You saved me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.63,0:08:23.70,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.53,0:08:28.13,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,You didn’t want me to call for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.34,0:08:33.24,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,I had to strain all my strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.84,0:08:40.75,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,I can. Remember the day when you had to lift 150 kg.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.61,0:08:43.35,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Strength is not in muscles,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.72,0:08:46.95,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,and in determination.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.09,0:08:56.06,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,Why did you climb into the well at such a time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.70,0:09:02.90,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,It was dark, I couldn’t see well and fell through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.30,0:09:06.04,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Are you night blind?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.04,0:09:07.84,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,It’s hard to get out of the well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.58,0:09:12.15,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Are you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.25,0:09:14.51,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.15,0:09:19.29,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Come here. Quicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.15,0:09:21.62,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Wait a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.79,0:09:25.96,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Log in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.47,0:09:43.74,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,I would have known that you would stay in the main house,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.78,0:09:46.58,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,would prepare a larger bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.78,0:09:50.42,Default,Spillie1,0,0,0,,Dad, no! No need, dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.42,0:09:53.25,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,Dad! Don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.25,0:09:55.72,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,No! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.72,0:09:56.99,Default,Spillie1,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.06,0:09:58.62,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.06,0:10:00.49,Default,Spillit1,0,0,0,,No need.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.89,0:10:03.06,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Thanks to your efforts
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.06,0:10:04.60,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,I felt comfortable here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.23,0:10:08.63,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,No need to bother you anymore,\NI will return to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.10,0:10:12.71,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,What does “trouble” mean? Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.04,0:10:16.18,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,I came to convey a message
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.18,0:10:18.64,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,the dowager queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.32,0:10:27.02,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,She sends for you every day, which means
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.02,0:10:29.72,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,she really really needs you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.02,0:10:33.89,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,Everything goes wrong in the palace without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.16,0:10:37.23,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.33,0:10:41.10,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Even if you are busy and tired, this is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.50,0:10:45.84,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Don't worry about anything, focus on the role of the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.67,0:10:49.61,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,I may not be the best father, but remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.61,0:10:51.38,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,I will always support you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.45,0:10:55.55,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.52,0:11:00.59,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Reach safely to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.12,0:11:04.96,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,I understand that this is impudent, but I ask you to take care of the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.03,0:11:11.63,Default,Spiky1,0,0,0,,I will pay more attention to her, she will not be lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.13,0:11:15.64,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,What happiness. I'm so grateful and embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.30,0:11:18.54,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,Can we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.62,0:11:35.92,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Depicts a caring dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.22,0:11:39.43,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,and he himself is just a grabber who uses his own child for profit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.69,0:11:44.46,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,He gave his daughter away to someone he tried to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.07,0:11:49.20,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,So the king wanted to kill Kim So-yeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.07,0:11:54.81,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,Why do you look like you’ve lost your country?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.54,0:11:56.61,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,This is not so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.08,0:12:00.35,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,If not a country, then something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.61,0:12:03.48,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,Wait, really lost it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.48,0:12:04.68,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.92,0:12:08.75,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,On such a beautiful day you return safely to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.39,0:12:12.49,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Despite my face, I am very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.93,0:12:15.16,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Okay, if so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.96,0:12:20.63,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,Isn’t it time for the blood feud to begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.63,0:12:26.44,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,But it seems like I forgot something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.87,0:12:30.28,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,It seems I had an important mission...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.44,0:12:32.85,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,What a handsome guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.61,0:12:35.01,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,He is so handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.08,0:12:36.92,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Really handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.49,0:12:47.76,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,Selection of royal concubines.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.26,0:12:50.06,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,How could I forget about such a great thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.33,0:12:52.06,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,I need to do something important, so for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.10,0:12:53.60,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Hon Young, let's go. Quicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.77,0:12:55.84,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Wait. Why are you running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.97,0:12:57.14,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.54,0:13:00.17,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.51,0:13:03.04,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,Here is a quick one. Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.85,0:13:06.91,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.42,0:13:17.62,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.51,0:13:34.54,Default,Silk1,0,0,0,,-Where is the chief eunuch?\N-I checked, he is busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.07,0:13:36.48,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,You couldn’t find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.54,0:13:38.14,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,The book disappeared into thin air.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.95,0:13:41.68,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,Maybe my father-in-law guessed and hid it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.02,0:13:44.35,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Not the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.35,0:13:46.89,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,His behavior did not change until my departure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.55,0:13:50.26,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,And he definitely doesn’t know how to hide his feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.79,0:13:52.19,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,So it was that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.99,0:13:54.56,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,In a mask from the Detective Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.56,0:13:58.63,Default,Spiky1,0,0,0,,If the accounting book fell into the hands of Kim Jwagyn, we will not see it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.63,0:14:00.63,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,He has no way of knowing where she was moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.63,0:14:02.50,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,This is such a thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.50,0:14:04.90,Default,Spiky1,0,0,0,,that your father-in-law will not be able to tell anyone that he lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.17,0:14:07.17,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,He will have to suffer alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.37,0:14:10.88,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,He will start looking for the accounting book.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.31,0:14:13.75,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,And will do it himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.75,0:14:15.38,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,Let them follow him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.48,0:14:16.52,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.62,0:14:18.99,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,I think finding her is a hopeless matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.22,0:14:20.45,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,It's time to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.45,0:14:22.82,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,Without a ledger, all our plans are in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.32,0:14:26.19,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,I won’t give up so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.13,0:14:31.06,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Act like a queen here, be polite.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.13,0:14:32.93,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,Hurry, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.70,0:14:35.77,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.47,0:14:37.67,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Hello, court lady Choi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.08,0:14:44.08,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.94,0:14:46.78,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,I missed you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.11,0:14:50.48,Default,Spillit1,0,0,0,,Court lady Choi. \NBring all the Joseon girls here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.12,0:14:53.75,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,And don’t miss the family register of the Khan clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.75,0:14:54.85,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,bring it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.09,0:14:58.89,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,I’m starting to select royal concubines.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.19,0:15:02.86,Default,Silk1,0,0,0,,Under the pretext of choosing concubines, I will study this family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.73,0:15:05.90,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,The choice of royal concubines is the solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.20,0:15:11.27,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly, I need to greet the Dowager Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.84,0:15:13.67,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Well, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.77,0:15:16.48,Default,Spillit1,0,0,0,,The soul of Jang Bong-hwan and the memories of Kim So-yeon -
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.48,0:15:19.88,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,ideal mixture for creating\N a flawless queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.62,0:15:25.02,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.35,0:15:27.72,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.39,0:15:30.79,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Has something changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.99,0:15:33.23,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,You look different.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.36,0:15:37.03,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,I was able to start all over again after returning home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.33,0:15:39.40,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,This is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.40,0:15:41.83,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Sorry for making you worry so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.03,0:15:46.11,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,And thank you that despite this,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.11,0:15:47.77,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,you understood me so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.68,0:15:52.24,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,To atone for what happened in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.24,0:15:55.25,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,I will try hard
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.25,0:15:57.32,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,play the role of the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.62,0:16:01.12,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,So you'll get to the most important things immediately?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.69,0:16:02.92,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,Now I know exactly what this is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.49,0:16:06.29,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,As soon as I felt better, I came,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.29,0:16:09.03,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.26,0:16:10.80,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,As expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.80,0:16:12.73,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,I was only gone for a couple of days,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.90,0:16:15.77,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,but I couldn’t help but think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.77,0:16:18.74,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,So we have the same feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.71,0:16:20.94,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,-Then...\N-Right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.94,0:16:22.21,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,-From this minute?\N-Shall we start?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.21,0:16:24.21,Default,Spillie1,0,0,0,,-Queen.\N-Good work!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.78,0:16:32.25,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,I wasn’t thinking about that at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.36,0:16:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.66,0:16:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking forward to your training.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.83,0:16:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, I am irreplaceable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.47,0:16:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t believe I’m sharing recipes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.37,0:16:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not ready to become a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.78,0:16:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? Out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.82,0:17:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.79,0:17:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You can come here whenever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.19,0:17:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But, I'm afraid, this won't work with the release.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.38,0:17:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.92,0:17:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty returned to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.09,0:17:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.09,0:17:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we go to Seongjeongjong Hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.59,0:17:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Let's go to the royal estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.10,0:17:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, the fire is too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.14,0:17:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So everything will turn into mush.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.38,0:18:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, flames are everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.68,0:18:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You can also see the flame in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.18,0:18:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This cannot be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.09,0:18:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I am committed to learning from you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.82,0:18:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,so my eyes sparkle with delight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.59,0:18:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, when will you teach the recipe?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.63,0:18:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you know how everything works in the kitchen\N. Don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.53,0:18:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,For newcomers to Chinese restaurants
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.80,0:18:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,for the first month you are only allowed to peel onions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.63,0:18:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.13,0:18:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I have been working in the royal kitchen for 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.34,0:18:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And 12 years as a royal chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.51,0:18:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t need a resume.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.71,0:18:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not start counting the days then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.95,0:18:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t like your attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.18,0:18:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.48,0:18:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.08,0:18:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And like this? Is that better?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.45,0:18:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Better? Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.22,0:18:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, open up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.93,0:18:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.44,0:19:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you looked now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.14,0:19:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is an industrial spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.07,0:19:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wondering if the heat was adjusted correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.61,0:19:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t need to think.\NI can handle this myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.08,0:19:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you constantly go too far?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.00,0:19:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Gukbap is a traditional food of commoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.20,0:19:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And the commander is high society.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.87,0:19:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll add some meat broth,\N French beef kukbap.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.61,0:19:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll get rid of the gamey taste with the help of proteins.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.15,0:19:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Uses egg whites in a whole new way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.29,0:19:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.89,0:20:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.56,0:20:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.19,0:20:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,May I know what kind of food\N you are trying to cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.40,0:20:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Food that touches the soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.14,0:20:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.55,0:20:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.85,0:20:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And the finishing touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.03,0:20:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-They are ready, right?\N-Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,"If the foam dies, I die too."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.87,0:20:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,With this attitude, try to save food and act quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.97,0:20:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So. Forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.14,0:20:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, Your Majesty.\N-Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.11,0:20:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.15,0:20:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,She will like it even more,\N because she knows the taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.79,0:21:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.02,0:21:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Damhyang!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.46,0:21:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so scared\N that I wouldn’t be able to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.30,0:21:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,True. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.11,0:21:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I made you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.61,0:21:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I should be scolded.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.45,0:21:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.03,0:21:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.83,0:21:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not imagining it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.83,0:21:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this rice and soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.80,0:21:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It also seems to me that this is rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.11,0:21:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Did she give me a kukbap?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.68,0:22:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,For royal meals\N you need to separate rice and soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.41,0:22:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you put rice in the soup,\N like some peasant?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.62,0:22:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I take it away?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.95,0:22:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.19,0:22:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.93,0:22:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,the queen put a lot of effort into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.60,0:22:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll at least try.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.10,0:22:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.62,0:22:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I was counting the days of my career
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.02,0:22:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,in the royal kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.62,0:22:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And lived a noble life as a royal cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.89,0:22:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But I became an ordinary servant who watches the fire all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.90,0:22:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,All because of the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.94,0:22:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not because I'm a bad cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.14,0:23:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is because the queen is unusually good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.04,0:23:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.08,0:23:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty!\N-Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.62,0:23:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.19,0:23:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty!\N-Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.80,0:23:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-And you?\N-And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.21,0:23:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty!\N-Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.01,0:23:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You are too cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.11,0:23:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The milk has not dried on your lips yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.08,0:23:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.95,0:23:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.55,0:23:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'm a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.42,0:23:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a damn great cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.76,0:23:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, exactly what we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.57,0:24:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you manage to get so close?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.83,0:24:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t hate her that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.14,0:24:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She attacked me just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.74,0:24:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I must be rotten,\Nlike spoiled vegetables in the summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.08,0:24:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire was blowing all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.32,0:24:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.19,0:24:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No. I didn't try to kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.49,0:24:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-I tried to explain to you...\N-Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.92,0:24:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-I...\N-Leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.76,0:24:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.87,0:24:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.93,0:24:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.31,0:24:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot insult Her Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.91,0:24:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,so as not to be on the same level as him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.48,0:24:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But I need to vent.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.32,0:24:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I was really going to stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.48,0:25:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is his face from?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.89,0:25:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.93,0:25:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No. No need.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.43,0:25:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! This cannot be!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.51,0:25:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dowager Queen, \NThe Queen requests an audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.05,0:25:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.43,0:25:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.36,0:26:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, such a heartless\N will not appreciate food for the soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.54,0:26:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.81,0:26:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I must have lost my skills because
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.54,0:26:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,was absent from the kitchen for some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.15,0:26:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Tastes both familiar and exotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.55,0:26:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Familiar, but exotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.42,0:26:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your outstanding culinary talents are beginning to scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.16,0:26:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You even brought back long-forgotten memories to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.96,0:26:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.80,0:26:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Good girl, eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.91,0:26:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.41,0:26:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.31,0:26:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-You have a grain of rice here.\N-How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.92,0:27:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But I heard that you don’t want to \Nshare your skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.59,0:27:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can't \Ntrain the royal chef?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.10,0:27:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.83,0:27:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This old man is getting on my nerves a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.67,0:27:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you need to get rid of it immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.80,0:27:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, there was an incident with arsenic.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.01,0:27:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Arsenic?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.54,0:27:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn’t know?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.98,0:27:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You have fallen into a vegetative state,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.75,0:27:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,because I swallowed \Npoison in the royal kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.52,0:27:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.95,0:27:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I wouldn’t have recovered so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.59,0:27:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.42,0:27:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The royal cook is a stupid old man,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.99,0:27:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but if you relieve him of his position...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.56,0:27:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Will I relieve you of your position?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.46,0:27:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We will behead him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.11,0:27:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder who has the accounting book now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.64,0:27:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And more importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.41,0:27:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,why did he take her?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.48,0:27:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Will this backfire on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.22,0:28:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Or will it help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.32,0:28:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He will lose his position or his head,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.12,0:28:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,what do I care?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.93,0:28:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They ask me to share recipes,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.26,0:28:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,which means that talk about overthrow is not a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.40,0:28:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not the old man I need to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.60,0:28:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to lose my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.94,0:28:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Cheoljong!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.08,0:28:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, the queen is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.94,0:28:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.30,0:28:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I was told this is how royals walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.07,0:28:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I am your ideal queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.74,0:28:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Who said?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.75,0:29:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Choi. Deceived?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.75,0:29:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.18,0:29:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is my ideal queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.89,0:29:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I am, as you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.09,0:29:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're scaring me. Be the same as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.26,0:29:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, what kind of women do you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.70,0:29:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sexual? Lovely? Innocent?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.94,0:29:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.47,0:29:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen Dowager said
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.84,0:29:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,select concubines for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.84,0:29:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The concubines are yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.48,0:29:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,so which ones do you prefer?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.71,0:29:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Concubines?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.75,0:29:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Royal concubines...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.35,0:29:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.65,0:29:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Showing your true colors?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.53,0:29:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.55,0:30:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I was too happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.55,0:30:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.22,0:30:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's be clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.46,0:30:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a king, but that doesn’t mean
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.89,0:30:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,that they belong to you. It's old fashioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.89,0:30:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They are not yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.40,0:30:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Great advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.83,0:30:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-This means that...\N-They are mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.20,0:30:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-What?\N-They belong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.64,0:30:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go near the harem.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.44,0:30:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a main concubine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.91,0:30:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.38,0:30:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Under one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.38,0:30:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-In your ear.\N-What? For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.98,0:30:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.92,0:30:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I will choose their gender.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.09,0:30:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.53,0:30:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I need looks, not pedigree.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.90,0:31:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I will tell the dowager queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.13,0:31:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,that I don’t need concubines.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.94,0:31:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.34,0:31:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let’s not violate other people’s borders.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.27,0:31:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Behind my appearance, you check their families.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.68,0:31:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You are my real anti-fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.18,0:31:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I was worried, but now I found a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.76,0:31:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.76,0:31:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not allowed to smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.29,0:31:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And you can’t grab my hand
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.56,0:31:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and lie on my stomach!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.03,0:31:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can’t do anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.57,0:31:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly. Everything is prohibited.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.30,0:31:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Do nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.21,0:31:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.08,0:31:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.68,0:31:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.69,0:31:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk to His Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.42,0:32:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.83,0:32:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you look for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.54,0:32:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the court maid sell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.34,0:32:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, she’s so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.27,0:32:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Was dressed as a court maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.84,0:32:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember what she looked like?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.51,0:32:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Depends on how much you pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.35,0:32:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back with the artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.95,0:32:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The clearer your memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.65,0:32:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,the more I will offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.27,0:32:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.74,0:32:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.41,0:32:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Break
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.49,0:33:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Fake, I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.99,0:33:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are these fake documents?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.12,0:33:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,These are not completely false identities.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.49,0:33:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,These are recovered documents of the deceased or missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.20,0:33:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Not done clumsily.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.93,0:33:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It was probably very expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.11,0:33:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.85,0:33:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So much effort,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.92,0:33:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,to become a low-ranking official?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.84,0:33:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, I must give you something secretly.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.48,0:34:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll wait at our usual place.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.28,0:34:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.62,0:34:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Yeonpyeong left the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.93,0:34:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then take this to His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.87,0:34:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.47,0:34:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Does she have something for the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.24,0:34:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Since she couldn't give it to him after seeing how well he got along with the queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.31,0:34:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,looks like something special.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.65,0:34:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Royal audience in 15 minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.99,0:34:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.02,0:34:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.13,0:34:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.17,0:34:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The main concubine wrote you a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.54,0:35:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,In person
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.51,0:35:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,While I was away, you didn’t stop working.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.98,0:35:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I have nothing to do here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.25,0:35:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Thank you, Your Majesty.\N-Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.39,0:35:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,To express my gratitude,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.46,0:35:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll throw a feast on Cart Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.46,0:35:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,People have many complaints, including about natural disasters.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.66,0:36:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Your generosity will make people think,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.23,0:36:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,that we are not interested in the order
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.44,0:36:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and we just want to have feasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.17,0:36:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I think a king should not behave this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.08,0:36:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yongjo however
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.91,0:36:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,celebrated recovery,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.41,0:36:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,arranging a luxurious feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.68,0:36:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The queen was exhausted from hard work
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.95,0:36:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and came out of the vegetative state.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.02,0:36:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to celebrate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.72,0:36:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We are still looking for the cause of her illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.46,0:36:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not installed at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.90,0:36:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,She fully recovered after two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.77,0:36:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just needed a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.30,0:36:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-However...\N-Queen
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.67,0:36:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,overcame a serious illness and recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.78,0:36:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to celebrate this good event.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.48,0:36:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The case is quite suitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.42,0:36:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.45,0:36:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It is my duty both as king and as her husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.69,0:36:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, this will not work.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.76,0:37:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,An attempt on the queen's life is a serious crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.96,0:37:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If you rush to arrange a feast...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.23,0:37:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Minister of War.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.33,0:37:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you glad that the queen has recovered?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.17,0:37:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Really
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.44,0:37:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,did you want the queen to get hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.31,0:37:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.04,0:37:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Use this case
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.18,0:37:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,is more important for political purposes than the queen’s health?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.42,0:37:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.29,0:37:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is your wish,\N we will gladly accept your will.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.59,0:37:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Then wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.90,0:37:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You had a good rest. Just overflowing with energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.38,0:37:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy of my enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.05,0:38:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I will defeat a barbarian with another barbarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.82,0:38:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Need to create a clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.22,0:38:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,opposing the Kims.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.06,0:38:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-Create?\N-Use
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.62,0:38:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,a concubine chosen by the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.19,0:38:11.86,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Royal chef, look?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.86,0:38:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, come on. Does it taste the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.20,0:38:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me try.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.70,0:38:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring some more seasoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.04,0:38:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I'll add a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.37,0:38:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that won’t work, it’s watery. Redo it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.61,0:38:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And why are you trying so hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.35,0:38:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The popularity of milk dishes will only grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.15,0:38:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot starve young calves.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.66,0:38:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So I want to replace the milk with something with a similar taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.96,0:38:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Molecular gastronomy in Joseon?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.57,0:38:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He tries so hard, especially today.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.97,0:38:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Royal Chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.21,0:38:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So much sadness in these eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.71,0:39:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he has a whole family to feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.35,0:39:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m listening to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.15,0:39:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Light up the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.86,0:39:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.13,0:39:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,On these small shoulders of the head of the family
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.66,0:39:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,a heavy burden lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.90,0:39:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So to think, I still don’t know your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.80,0:39:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.51,0:39:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Manbok.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.91,0:39:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me about your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.84,0:39:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I think there are 10 people in your family,\Nand everyone needs to be fed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.31,0:39:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.52,0:39:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.55,0:39:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been enjoying the life of a bachelor for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.92,0:39:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t you have a family to feed?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.96,0:39:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Think again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.36,0:39:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I sometimes feed stray cats fish heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.70,0:39:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct. Do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.24,0:40:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Without you, stray cats will starve.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.14,0:40:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not doing this for you, but for those stray cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.68,0:40:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I will share the recipe with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.41,0:40:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.65,0:40:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about. You're frightening.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.56,0:40:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, bring me the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.04,0:40:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hon Young.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.14,0:40:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Deliver this to the royal physician.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.57,0:40:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.05,0:40:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Recommend aromatic herbs that are good for the skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.65,0:40:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don’t like it, get a new assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.42,0:40:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,New assignment?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.73,0:40:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s also on the back side.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.60,0:41:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a eunuch here to choose a royal concubine.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.60,0:41:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does she always try to make a eunuch out of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.75,0:41:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.45,0:41:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your time. You can hurt yourself this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.79,0:41:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Where can I find books about royal feasts?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.66,0:41:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll look for them for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.74,0:41:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I am interested in the royal feast at Yeongjo.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.58,0:41:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.36,0:42:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I went to the Seongwonjong hall,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.29,0:42:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,and I was told that you were heading here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.96,0:42:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,To what do I owe the pleasure of seeing you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.83,0:42:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I just thought that we rarely see each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.50,0:42:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.19,0:42:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.93,0:42:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it because you made the tea yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.87,0:42:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The taste is more refined.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.94,0:42:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,When I look at you, I remember the late king.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.75,0:42:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was hard for me to stay close to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.05,0:43:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for not realizing this earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.85,0:43:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I knew a lot about the late king.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.33,0:43:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But perhaps the late king,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.73,0:43:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,my son,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.73,0:43:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,was a greater king than I thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.30,0:43:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,judging by the fact
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.84,0:43:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,how he fought with the Kims for supreme power.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.94,0:43:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I reproach myself for
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.31,0:43:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,that she could not summon her kind
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.18,0:43:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,support the king and his cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.42,0:43:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t blame yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.96,0:43:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the late king wouldn't want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.96,0:43:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that if I could
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.97,0:43:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,correct my mistake with your help?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.03,0:44:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I am in many ways inferior to the late king.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.47,0:44:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.67,0:44:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If you share the late king's goal,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.21,0:44:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.95,0:44:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not repeat my mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.42,0:44:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.22,0:44:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m very glad that I was able to get to know you a little today.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.53,0:44:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.16,0:44:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.78,0:45:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll wait at our usual place.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.37,0:45:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.54,0:45:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. How long have you been waiting for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.98,0:45:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.12,0:45:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you wouldn’t come, so I came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.89,0:45:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I read the letter late.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.09,0:45:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So you were busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.29,0:45:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So much so that they even forgot about the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.06,0:46:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,In truth, the Queen Mother came
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.57,0:46:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.00,0:46:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.47,0:46:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a normal conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.38,0:46:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you have
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.81,0:46:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,more and more secrets from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.85,0:46:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what did you discuss with the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.55,0:46:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,When you were at the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.12,0:46:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-Did you see?\N-Shouldn’t you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.16,0:46:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.86,0:46:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We discussed the selection of royal concubines.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.96,0:46:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Concubines.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.13,0:46:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you refused.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.97,0:46:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to distract the Kims' attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.31,0:46:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If we collide them with another enemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.67,0:46:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,they will forget about the throne for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.68,0:46:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So you agreed to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.15,0:46:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.\N-This is all the machinations of the queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.88,0:46:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Royal Consort.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.95,0:46:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you call me the royal consort?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.49,0:46:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don’t you call me by name anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.06,0:47:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You said that only I can make you happy or sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.50,0:47:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But now
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.26,0:47:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,this isn’t about me anymore, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.17,0:47:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hwajin.\N-Please tell me how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.57,0:47:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Really
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.78,0:47:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,have you fallen in love with the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.82,0:47:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The basis of Western cuisine is sauce and dressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.09,0:47:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,At the same time, refueling is the main highlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.86,0:47:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Try.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.46,0:47:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If I use this, can I make milk from beans?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.90,0:47:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But why are you alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.67,0:47:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.11,0:47:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t have time to get married because of my full-time job.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.64,0:47:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What about parents and other relatives?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.68,0:47:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,In 1839, all Catholics were killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.35,0:47:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So I was left alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.92,0:48:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did they become Catholics?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.76,0:48:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s why I don’t believe in anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.43,0:48:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Catholic persecution.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.43,0:48:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.70,0:48:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not the only one who ended up like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.84,0:48:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a little sad to spend the holidays alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.81,0:48:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,but the plus is,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.61,0:48:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,that they died on the same day,\Nso the wake is only once a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.62,0:48:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with all of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.36,0:48:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know that I am susceptible to the smell of sadness?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.43,0:48:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-The smell of sadness?\N-The food smells of sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.56,0:48:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,When the cook is sad and the food is saturated with sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.20,0:48:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.57,0:48:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, whether it be happiness or sadness,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.84,0:48:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I left all my emotions at the door,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.04,0:48:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,before entering the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.41,0:49:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But you always get mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.91,0:49:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because whenever you come, you upset me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.38,0:49:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Blame yourself for lack of practice. No others are needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.49,0:49:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.76,0:49:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.56,0:49:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say “this”?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.93,0:49:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.96,0:49:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s even worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.80,0:49:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We should have let you be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.03,0:49:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.12,0:49:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I just ate.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.42,0:49:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.43,0:49:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not for food. Attach
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.97,0:49:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,to your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.91,0:50:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So I will become indispensable:
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.28,0:50:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Korean food and Korean personal care.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.52,0:50:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather right for drying vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.07,0:50:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.18,0:50:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t see you yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.54,0:50:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you didn’t have a bad hangover.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.75,0:50:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for leaving my post.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.19,0:50:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.10,0:51:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember what happened before you fell into a vegetative state?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.37,0:51:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Not noticed anything or anyone suspicious?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.10,0:51:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Under someone suspicious
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.37,0:51:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,who do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.64,0:51:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.21,0:51:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, to be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.71,0:51:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I think my condition was associated with otherworldly forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.51,0:51:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,By otherworldly forces\N do you mean the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.28,0:51:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.22,0:51:26.69,Default,dash,0,0,0,,I mean, it happened naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.69,0:51:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be shocked, but I will say it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.86,0:51:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I suspect the king is involved in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.20,0:51:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,According to investigation,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.20,0:51:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,the man who attacked you at Octajeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.27,0:51:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,was sent by His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.64,0:51:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Knew you'd be shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.94,0:51:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.81,0:51:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Only I know about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.28,0:51:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.92,0:51:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that’s the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.08,0:51:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is very confusing,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.09,0:51:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,so we decided to forget about this incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.12,0:52:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And you behaved as if nothing had happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.56,0:52:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you continue to love him despite what he did?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.13,0:52:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Love?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.87,0:52:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What an abomination!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.13,0:52:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to live here happily,\N I must get along with the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.51,0:52:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.61,0:52:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how could you...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.88,0:52:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already confused,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.98,0:52:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and you’re talking about love here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.35,0:52:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How is the choice of concubines?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.55,0:52:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Choi!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.98,0:52:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Choi!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.32,0:52:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Girls, I’m here!..
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.16,0:52:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are the candidates?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.63,0:52:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.78,0:52:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.78,0:52:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so looking forward to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.68,0:53:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.17,0:53:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t refuse the kaleidoscope.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.05,0:53:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,She went this far for our family?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.03,0:53:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Once again, what is it called?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.03,0:53:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,She called it the veil of beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.70,0:53:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I was looking for someone to replace her with,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.17,0:53:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and she gave me a new treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.11,0:54:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.74,0:54:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the head of the Detective Department, Kim Byungin.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.31,0:54:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,At this hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.98,0:54:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.37,0:54:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I mentioned you in a conversation with my brother, so he told you to come,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.27,0:54:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's too late now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.24,0:54:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I did not receive such a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.84,0:54:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I dared to insist on meeting with you, as I must
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.54,0:54:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,say something to bypass your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.45,0:54:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps my father
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.85,0:54:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,said that His Majesty is different from his predecessor.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.99,0:54:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But he was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.24,0:55:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.48,0:55:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.05,0:55:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.12,0:55:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s just a trifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.96,0:55:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,A little red ginseng.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.93,0:55:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Here, take it.\N-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.00,0:55:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.11,0:55:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,With what?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.71,0:55:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to talk in riddles, get to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.04,0:55:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.65,0:55:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just wondering how things were going.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.55,0:55:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume Benin is still in the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.56,0:56:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.43,0:56:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'm back.\N-You're late today.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.90,0:56:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,There is never time to just be with colleagues,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.37,0:56:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,so I drank with them at the Detective Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.51,0:56:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.18,0:56:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s too late. Go get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.01,0:56:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, return to your conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.78,0:56:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.49,0:56:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-Minister\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.99,0:56:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Look worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.90,0:56:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Bitting more than you can chew will make you nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.33,0:56:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What... I don’t quite understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.94,0:56:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t understand that you can
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.27,0:56:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,bring disaster to yourself and the queen with your recklessness?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.34,0:56:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If I’m worried, it’s because
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.11,0:56:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,that it was not possible to capture the one who attacked the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.28,0:56:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Is this so?\N-Well, it’s too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.32,0:56:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.65,0:57:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I just came in to give a gift,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.49,0:57:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.33,0:57:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He lost the ledger.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.07,0:57:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If he had nothing to do with it, does that mean Byonin acted on his own?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.27,0:57:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And if not...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.67,0:57:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.07,0:57:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, it’s not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.81,0:57:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Took a long time
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.88,0:57:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,find a similar body.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.08,0:58:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.78,0:58:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,She drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.55,0:58:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The face cannot be recognized because it has been in the water for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.16,0:58:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.96,0:58:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.17,0:58:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,fell in love with the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.34,0:58:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.94,0:58:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,must not love the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.68,0:58:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t deny that you’re in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.65,0:58:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Just say that you shouldn’t love.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.17,0:58:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, Prince Yeonpyeong is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.17,0:58:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sign in.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.18,0:59:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the late visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.92,0:59:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the news you've been waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.19,0:59:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you found Ovol?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.00,0:59:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you give this to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.77,0:59:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is my gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.34,0:59:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The lady of the court sold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.14,0:59:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So Ovol is alive. What a blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.92,0:59:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why send me for water in the middle of the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.95,0:59:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They couldn’t ask before.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.06,0:59:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something stuck there?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.60,1:00:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.68,1:00:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I hired an artist to paint a portrait of that lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.62,1:00:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as we see it, we’ll know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.66,1:00:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I really thought of a way to help the king...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.50,1:00:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.54,1:00:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,In the well...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.67,1:00:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-In the well?\N-They found a body there.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.11,1:00:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Ovol, your maid.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.18,1:00:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ovol?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.25,1:00:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-What should we do?\N-That’s the problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.76,1:01:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This may hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.66,1:01:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Let me...\N-No.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.30,1:01:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to see for myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.00,1:01:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Have you seen this?\N-This is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.54,1:01:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like she was under water for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.98,1:01:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand how painful this must be.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.94,1:02:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.81,1:02:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I just started.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.94,1:02:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.48,1:02:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.66,1:03:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.09,1:03:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,who makes me happy and sad.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.70,1:03:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, the Queen Dowager is here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.81,1:03:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What brings you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.32,1:03:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you read?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.99,1:03:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So, one of the requests that I missed.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.93,1:03:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You look more animated than usual,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.30,1:03:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,so I’m curious how I spent my time outside the palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.33,1:03:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s what I came to ask about.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.20,1:03:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It was good to forget for a while
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.97,1:03:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,about palace affairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.11,1:04:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.48,1:04:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.41,1:04:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish you happiness.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.39,1:04:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.35,1:04:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been through so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.83,1:04:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you already forgotten about everything?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.63,1:04:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Fate can be inherited.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.57,1:04:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You will learn to be grateful for your situation and do nothing,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.13,1:04:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,you and those you love will remain safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.51,1:04:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So why can’t you just sit and do nothing?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.25,1:04:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Be smart, king.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.25,1:04:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I will, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.29,1:05:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Secret
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.28,1:05:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Be smart,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.62,1:05:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,my baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.23,1:06:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Some people live in a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.02,1:07:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen's Dictionary.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.30,1:07:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Social distancing
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.87,1:07:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,so everyone is on their own.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.31,1:07:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Antifan: powerful spiritual guide
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.12,1:07:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,fan, social networks, phone,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.52,1:07:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,showdown, let's light up,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.12,1:07:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,special forces, lottery, jackpot.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.49,1:07:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But they often find
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.26,1:07:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,your own can overcome nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.69,1:08:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.06,1:08:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.60,1:08:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.73,1:08:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.98,1:08:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But only for pleasant dreams
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.42,1:08:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,drive away your nightmare...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.06,1:08:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-I want a hug too.\N-And you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.89,1:08:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.00,1:08:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-Bliss!\N-Queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.10,1:08:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,New nightmare
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.31,1:09:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,finds you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.34,1:09:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.64,1:09:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Lost your voice, are you hoarse, should you call me?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.52,1:09:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell did you forget here?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.16,1:09:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.23,1:09:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Today
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.93,1:09:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,no social distancing.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.40,1:10:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this my heart? Or is the body asking?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.47,1:10:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Director Han?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.84,1:10:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is rotten!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.37,1:10:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We will do everything to get the ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.28,1:10:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The King on Cart Day wants to look strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.35,1:10:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.55,1:10:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There are always those who take competitions so seriously.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.49,1:10:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of glare is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.49,1:10:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So I have to teach you a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.66,1:10:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll show you who’s boss in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.16,1:10:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,


